            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What are the dimensions of these white pillar candles?",
            "text": "<p>Our classic pillar candles are available in two sizes:</p><p>2.25\" diameter x 3\" height</p><p>2.25\" diameter x 4.75\" height</p><p></p><p>White pillar candles bulk are perfect for centerpieces, event décor, or everyday ambiance.</p>"
