            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How long do these candles burn?",
            "text": "<p>Burn times may vary slightly based on conditions, but on average:</p><p>The 2.25\" x 3\" candle burns for approximately 20-25 hours</p><p>The 2.25\" x 4.75\" candle burns for approximately 35-40 hours</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_DeiLtr": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What kind of wax are these white pillar candles made from?",
            "text": "<p>These white pillar candles bulk are made from high-quality paraffin wax, designed to burn cleanly and evenly with minimal dripping and smoke. We use 100% cotton wicks that are lead-free and designed for a clean, stable burn.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_PbztCG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Are these unscented pillar candles dripless?",
            "text": "<p>These bulk pillar candles are considered drip-resistant when burned in optimal, draft-free conditions and placed on a level surface.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_abEwEK": {
