            "title": "Can I use these bulk pillar candles outdoors?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, but outdoor conditions like wind or uneven surfaces may affect burn quality and drip performance. For best results, use in covered or sheltered outdoor settings.</p>"
          }
        }
